WEBVTT

00:30:56.602 --> 00:31:00.126
Ironically, it can be lonelier
than working alone.

00:31:00.150 --> 00:31:03.321
At PencilWorks, the long floors
are divided into smaller offices

00:31:03.345 --> 00:31:04.811
with glass walls.

00:31:04.835 --> 00:31:06.445
You can see into each of them,

00:31:06.469 --> 00:31:08.876
but that doesn't make it
easier to interact.

00:31:08.900 --> 00:31:11.738
Our producers Constanza and Jessica
went looking for people

00:31:11.762 --> 00:31:13.406
to participate in Jane's exercise.

00:31:13.430 --> 00:31:16.104
Constanza: I can see their faces.
They're looking at us!

00:31:16.128 --> 00:31:19.147
Jessica: Hi, do you guys have
15 minutes and want free cookies?

00:31:19.171 --> 00:31:21.247
Man: No, I'm sorry.
Jessica: OK, no worries.

00:31:21.271 --> 00:31:24.656
AG: Finally, the promise of free
baked goods secured a few participants.

00:31:24.680 --> 00:31:26.564
Constanza: Yeah? OK. Amazing!

00:31:26.588 --> 00:31:29.534
AG: Our producers explain the exercise
to the group assembled:

00:31:29.558 --> 00:31:32.316
try to form a high-quality
connection in one minute.